WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.520
Trump's invasion force is not going after the worst of the worst, like he said.

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:12.600
They're harassing and detaining many people based only on the color of their skin.

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:18.400
Tamale vendors, delivery people, people looking for work at Home Depot, and even families

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:21.400
just out and about enjoying themselves on a sunny day.

